    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.poster.avif?t=1751386713\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.webm?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.mp4?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Sivers \u2014 A Vector-Style RPG Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the unique world of <i>Sivers</i> \u2014 a dynamic RPG roguelike where every battle and decision can be crucial for survival! In this game, you\u2019ll fight off waves of monsters using a construction system and powerful spells to hold your ground for as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/ce465583c6edc218d48b971baedbabb3.poster.avif?t=1751386713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/ce465583c6edc218d48b971baedbabb3.webm?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/ce465583c6edc218d48b971baedbabb3.mp4?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>43 Spells:</strong> Choose from magical, physical, and passive spells to adapt to various situations and defeat your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Bosses and 20 Types of Enemies:</strong> Each wave of monsters gets progressively harder, with unique mechanics. Enemies and bosses require different strategies and spell combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Types of Structures:</strong> Build towers, fences, mines, and spawners for allied units to strengthen your defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Progression System:</strong> Earn experience and building points for every enemy you defeat. Upgrade your hero\u2019s stats and unlock new construction possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes and Secret Shops:</strong> Collect runes for bonuses, and don't forget to visit the secret shop where you can use coins to unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Selection:</strong> Adjust the game\u2019s difficulty to either increase the challenge or make it easier on yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Interface and Smooth Building Mechanics:</strong> Easily upgrade your structures and keep track of their development in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c0adc0a8167b42354ffe1c22e355109a.poster.avif?t=1751386713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c0adc0a8167b42354ffe1c22e355109a.webm?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c0adc0a8167b42354ffe1c22e355109a.mp4?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game continues to evolve with each update, adding new abilities, mechanics, and possibilities. Fight, build, survive \u2014 and find your path to victory!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.poster.avif?t=1751386713\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.webm?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.mp4?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Sivers \u2014 A Vector-Style RPG Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the unique world of <i>Sivers</i> \u2014 a dynamic RPG roguelike where every battle and decision can be crucial for survival! In this game, you\u2019ll fight off waves of monsters using a construction system and powerful spells to hold your ground for as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/ce465583c6edc218d48b971baedbabb3.poster.avif?t=1751386713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/ce465583c6edc218d48b971baedbabb3.webm?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/ce465583c6edc218d48b971baedbabb3.mp4?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>43 Spells:</strong> Choose from magical, physical, and passive spells to adapt to various situations and defeat your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Bosses and 20 Types of Enemies:</strong> Each wave of monsters gets progressively harder, with unique mechanics. Enemies and bosses require different strategies and spell combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Types of Structures:</strong> Build towers, fences, mines, and spawners for allied units to strengthen your defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Progression System:</strong> Earn experience and building points for every enemy you defeat. Upgrade your hero\u2019s stats and unlock new construction possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runes and Secret Shops:</strong> Collect runes for bonuses, and don't forget to visit the secret shop where you can use coins to unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Selection:</strong> Adjust the game\u2019s difficulty to either increase the challenge or make it easier on yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Interface and Smooth Building Mechanics:</strong> Easily upgrade your structures and keep track of their development in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c0adc0a8167b42354ffe1c22e355109a.poster.avif?t=1751386713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c0adc0a8167b42354ffe1c22e355109a.webm?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c0adc0a8167b42354ffe1c22e355109a.mp4?t=1751386713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game continues to evolve with each update, adding new abilities, mechanics, and possibilities. Fight, build, survive \u2014 and find your path to victory!</p>",
    "short_description": "Sivers is a vector-style RPG roguelike where you\u2019ll fight waves of enemies using 43 spells and a building system. Build defenses and upgrade your hero, then try to survive against 5 bosses and 11 types of enemies. You definitely won\u2019t win on your first try \u2014 but give it a shot!",
